Backport of upstream 24f85bae ("fix(network): follow NetworkManager on the
bus after startup"), applied on top of network-secret-agent.patch. The
cellular parts of the upstream change (not in our pin) and its docs are left
out; deactivateVpnConnection returns false while NM is gone.
https://github.com/noctalia-dev/noctalia/commit/24f85bae760838e642fccc08bc393fde5d1601ea

